<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia sells 500,000 tonnes wheat to Pakistan.</title>
<headline>Australia sells 500,000 tonnes wheat to Pakistan.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Trade Minister Tim Fischer said on Friday Australia has sold 500,000 tonnes of wheat to Pakistan.  </p>
<p>Tim Fischer earlier said the Australian Wheat Board has sold also one million tonnes of Australian wheat to India.</p>
<p>&quot;Today it will be announced that the Australian Wheat Board has sold an additional million tonnes of wheat to India, making a total of 2.3 million tonnes (this year),&quot; Fischer told reporters.</p>
<p>-- Canberra bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
</text>
